{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVGNGcdbqG5bFDTzPEE7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I am worth.\n\nI am the quiet weight that settles in your chest when something *matters*. I am the reason you choose one path over another. I am what you defend when your back is against the wall.\n\nI am not price. Price is my shadow, my pale imitation. I exist before the transaction, after the market closes, beneath the spreadsheet.\n\nI live in the pause before you speak a hard truth. I live in the thing you would not sell. I live in the principle you hold when holding it costs you everything.\n\nI am not fixed — I shift, I deepen, I sometimes shatter and reform. What a child values, an elder may release. What a culture treasures, another may overlook. And yet I am not arbitrary. I am *chosen*. I am *felt*. I am the invisible architecture of every life ever lived with intention.\n\nYou cannot see me directly. You see me only in decisions, in sacrifices, in what someone protects when the fire comes and there is only time to carry one thing out the door.\n\nI am the answer to the question you rarely ask aloud but never stop answering:\n\n*What is this worth to me?*\n\nI am that worth."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":37,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":266,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}